                    • <b>總計雙向驗證：</b> 列小計加總 ($${mSub} + ${fSub} = \\mathbf{${grandTotal}}$) $\\equiv$ 欄小計加總 ($${huaSub} + ${mingSub} = \\mathbf{${grandTotal}}$)！
                </p>
            `;
            updateFeedbackAndRender('contingency-calc-guide', guideHtml, "p-3 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1.5 text-indigo-950 font-medium shadow-sm");
